*> Generalized linear models on iris: a logistic regression (versicolor vs. virginica)
*> with its predicted-probability curve, then a Poisson regression for contrast.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=glm_iris_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GLM-IRIS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

78 GRID-N VALUE 100.

*> Columns built from iris, up to 150 values each.
01 IS-VIRGINICA-COL.
   05 IS-VIRGINICA USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 PETAL-LENGTH-COL.
   05 PETAL-LENGTH USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 PETAL-WIDTH-COL.
   05 PETAL-WIDTH USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 COUNT-COL.
   05 COUNT-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 SEPAL-WIDTH-COL.
   05 SEPAL-WIDTH USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 ALL-PETAL-LENGTH-COL.
   05 ALL-PETAL-LENGTH USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 GRID-X-COL.
   05 GRID-X USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 100.
01 WIDTH-COL.
   05 WIDTH-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 100.
*> COLUMN-VALUES is the source table for ADD-COLUMN.
01 COLUMN-VALUES.
   05 COLUMN-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 COLUMN-COUNT USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 COLUMN-NAME  PIC X(32).

01 IRIS        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SUB         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 GRID        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 COUNT-DATA  USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FRAME       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 LOGIT       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 POISSON     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FITTED      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NROWS       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ROW         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 N           USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 I           USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 CORRECT     USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 SPECIES     PIC X(32).
01 ACCURACY    USAGE COMP-2.
01 WIDTH-SUM   USAGE COMP-2.
01 WIDTH-MEAN  USAGE COMP-2.
01 PL-MIN      USAGE COMP-2.
01 PL-MAX      USAGE COMP-2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_iris" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS

    *> Logistic regression: versicolor vs. virginica only. Setosa is perfectly separable
    *> from the other two on these predictors, which sends logistic regression's
    *> coefficients toward +/-infinity (a genuine degeneracy of the method, not a bug),
    *> so this is the well-behaved binary split for a demo.
    MOVE 0 TO N
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
        MOVE "Species" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
        CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO SPECIES
        IF SPECIES = "versicolor" OR SPECIES = "virginica"
            ADD 1 TO N
            IF SPECIES = "virginica"
                MOVE 1.0 TO IS-VIRGINICA(N)
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0 TO IS-VIRGINICA(N)
            END-IF
            MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-LENGTH(N)
            MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-WIDTH(N)
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM

    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO SUB
    MOVE SUB TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE N TO COLUMN-COUNT
    MOVE PETAL-LENGTH-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE PETAL-WIDTH-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE IS-VIRGINICA-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "is_virginica" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN

    DISPLAY "=================== Logistic regression (binomial, logit link) ==================="
    MOVE SUB TO DM-GLM-NEW-DATA
    MOVE "is_virginica ~ Petal.Length + Petal.Width" TO DM-GLM-NEW-FORMULA
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GLM-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "binomial" TO DM-GLM-NEW-FAMILY
    CALL "dm_glm_new" USING DM-GLM-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLM-NEW-RESULT TO LOGIT
    MOVE LOGIT TO DM-GLM-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_glm_print_summary" USING DM-GLM-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    MOVE LOGIT TO DM-GLM-FITTED-VALUES-SELF
    CALL "dm_glm_fitted_values" USING DM-GLM-FITTED-VALUES DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLM-FITTED-VALUES-RESULT TO FITTED
    MOVE FITTED TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-START
    CALL "dm_vector_double_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE 0 TO CORRECT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N
        IF (DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I) >= 0.5 AND IS-VIRGINICA(I) >= 0.5)
           OR (DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I) < 0.5 AND IS-VIRGINICA(I) < 0.5)
            ADD 1 TO CORRECT
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE FITTED TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    COMPUTE ACCURACY = 100.0 * CORRECT / N
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Resubstitution accuracy at 0.5 threshold: " ACCURACY "%"

    MOVE LOGIT TO DM-GLM-SAVE-DIAGNOSTIC-PLOTS-SELF
    MOVE "glm_logistic_iris" TO DM-GLM-SAVE-DIAGNOSTIC-PLOTS-PATH-PREFIX
    CALL "dm_glm_save_diagnostic_plots" USING DM-GLM-SAVE-DIAGNOSTIC-PLOTS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved glm_logistic_iris_{residuals_vs_fitted,normal_qq,scale_location,"
        "residuals_vs_leverage}.svg"

    *> Predicted-probability curve across Petal.Length, with Petal.Width held at its
    *> mean: the classic sigmoid of a fitted logistic regression, with a 95% band.
    MOVE 0 TO WIDTH-SUM
    MOVE PETAL-LENGTH(1) TO PL-MIN PL-MAX
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N
        ADD PETAL-WIDTH(I) TO WIDTH-SUM
        IF PETAL-LENGTH(I) < PL-MIN MOVE PETAL-LENGTH(I) TO PL-MIN END-IF
        IF PETAL-LENGTH(I) > PL-MAX MOVE PETAL-LENGTH(I) TO PL-MAX END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    COMPUTE WIDTH-MEAN = WIDTH-SUM / N
    SUBTRACT 0.3 FROM PL-MIN
    ADD 0.3 TO PL-MAX
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > GRID-N
        COMPUTE GRID-X(I) = PL-MIN + (PL-MAX - PL-MIN) * (I - 1) / (GRID-N - 1)
        MOVE WIDTH-MEAN TO WIDTH-VALUE(I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO GRID
    MOVE GRID TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE GRID-N TO COLUMN-COUNT
    MOVE GRID-X-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE WIDTH-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE LOGIT TO DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME-SELF
    MOVE GRID TO DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME-NEWDATA
    MOVE 2 TO DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME-GIVEN
    MOVE "confidence" TO DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME-INTERVAL-KIND
    CALL "dm_glm_predict_frame" USING DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLM-PREDICT-FRAME-RESULT TO FRAME
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Predicted-probability curve (first 5 rows):"
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-GIVEN
    MOVE 5 TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-MAX-ROWS
    CALL "dm_data_frame_to_string" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT-LENGTH)
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    *> Poisson regression, for contrast: same IRLS engine, different family/link.
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Poisson regression (log link) ==================="
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
        COMPUTE COUNT-VALUE(ROW + 1) = FUNCTION INTEGER(DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT + 0.5)
        MOVE "Sepal.Width" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO SEPAL-WIDTH(ROW + 1)
        MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO ALL-PETAL-LENGTH(ROW + 1)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO COUNT-DATA
    MOVE COUNT-DATA TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE NROWS TO COLUMN-COUNT
    MOVE SEPAL-WIDTH-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Sepal.Width" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE ALL-PETAL-LENGTH-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    MOVE COUNT-COL TO COLUMN-VALUES
    MOVE "count" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN

    MOVE COUNT-DATA TO DM-GLM-NEW-DATA
    MOVE "count ~ Sepal.Width + Petal.Length" TO DM-GLM-NEW-FORMULA
    MOVE "poisson" TO DM-GLM-NEW-FAMILY
    CALL "dm_glm_new" USING DM-GLM-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLM-NEW-RESULT TO POISSON
    MOVE POISSON TO DM-GLM-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_glm_print_summary" USING DM-GLM-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    MOVE POISSON TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE COUNT-DATA TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE GRID TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE LOGIT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SUB TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Adds the first COLUMN-COUNT COLUMN-VALUES as column COLUMN-NAME of the frame in
*> DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF.
ADD-COLUMN.
    MOVE COLUMN-COUNT TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > COLUMN-COUNT
        MOVE COLUMN-VALUE(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-VALUES
    CALL "dm_data_frame_add_numeric_column" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Reads iris column DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME at ROW.
NUMERIC-AT.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
